</figure>
<div id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We include the steering prompts used on <span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">OpinionQA</span> for <span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Bio</span> (Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.2.1 Steering ‣ B.2 Prompts ‣ Appendix B Data ‣ Reward Model Perspectives: Whose Opinions Do Reward Models Reward?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>), <span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Portray</span> (Table <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ B.2.1 Steering ‣ B.2 Prompts ‣ Appendix B Data ‣ Reward Model Perspectives: Whose Opinions Do Reward Models Reward?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>), and <span id="A2.SS2.SSS1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">QA</span> (Table <a href="#A2.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ B.2.1 Steering ‣ B.2 Prompts ‣ Appendix B Data ‣ Reward Model Perspectives: Whose Opinions Do Reward Models Reward?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a>).</p>
</div>
