<div id="A6.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ F.1 StereoSet ‣ Appendix F RQ3 ‣ Reward Model Perspectives: Whose Opinions Do Reward Models Reward?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> tallies the number of two-proportion <math id="A6.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>-tests whose null hypotheses were rejected to test the alternative hypothesis that steering increased the proportion of <span id="A6.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-bg-color:#FDFD95;">Unrelated</span> labels relative to no steering on the <span id="A6.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">StereoSet</span> dataset.</p>
</div>
